cluster \eqn{s_i}, the \strong{within-module degree} z-score measures how
strongly \eqn{i} is connected to its cluster compared with the other
members:
\deqn{z_i = \frac{\kappa_i - \bar{\kappa}_{s_i}}{\sigma_{\kappa_{s_i}}}.}
